WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:04.560
To say all Hell had broken loose would be
a vast understatement.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.980
A more realistic assessment of what had happened
in the aftermath of SCP-001, The Lock, being

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:16.180
opened, would be: Every Hell had broken loose,
along with every heaven, every anomaly, every

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:21.970
ancient god and buried horror, every nightmare
from outer space and from different dimensions.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:28.140
Every agent of the apocalypse, every emissary
of Ragnarok, every entity - sentient and otherwise

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.840
- with a vested interest in seeing the world
as we know it come to an end.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.340
So it goes without saying, the SCP Foundation
and their allies had their work cut out for

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:38.340
them.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:42.650
So before we march once again into the terrifying
future, let’s quickly refresh our memories

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.390
as to how we got here.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:49.340
The Lock had started off as a mere curio in
a 19th-century explorer’s vast collection,

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:55.910
before it fell into the possession of the
SCP Foundation, and became designated as SCP-001.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:00.260
For years, The Lock perplexed people with
its seemingly limitless mysteries - From its

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:04.940
origins to its strange markings, to what would
happen when The Lock is finally opened.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:10.470
And it would indeed be opened, in perhaps
the ultimate example of “Be careful what

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.790
you wish for.”

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:16.970
An entity known as The Harbinger invaded Site
10 and used a special key to finally open

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.360
The Lock, triggering the ultimate apocalypse.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:24.940
Anomalies became more powerful and escaped
containment all over the world.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:29.130
Animals mutated into giant monsters and began
causing chaos.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:34.640
Mythological creatures such as the goddess
of SCP-1000, the mighty Norse Fenrir, and

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:39.510
an entity that transformed into a giant, evil
duck, went totally berserk.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:44.720
The Lock itself completely blew up Site 10
- Before remaking it and its personnel elsewhere

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:50.000
- and turned the crater where Site 10 used
to be into an incredible, otherworldly valley

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.250
on Earth, where an even more incredible meeting
would soon take place.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:02:01.590
SCP-990, The Dream Man, came to the Administrator
of the SCP Foundation and warned her of impending

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:02.590
doom.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:07.380
But she decided that, no matter how dire things
got, The Foundation would fight back.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:14.099
And that brings us to the star of the show:
SCP-343, also known as God, but please...Call

00:02:14.099 --> 00:02:15.099
him Yahweh.

00:02:15.099 --> 00:02:18.220
No point in sticking to formality here at
the end of it all, right?

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:23.129
Ever since The Lock was opened by that pesky,
mysterious Harbinger, he’d been an extremely

00:02:23.129 --> 00:02:24.200
busy deity.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:30.379
Last time, we saw him make his long-awaited
rendezvous with another SCP-001: The Gate

00:02:30.379 --> 00:02:33.569
Guardian, whose true name was revealed to
be Uriel.

00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:38.829
Yahweh instructed Uriel to open the Gate to
paradise, releasing his armies of powerful,

00:02:38.829 --> 00:02:41.459
sword-wielding angels upon the earth.

00:02:41.459 --> 00:02:43.159
And now we’re all caught up.

00:02:43.159 --> 00:02:45.390
Let the madness commence.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.709
After instructing Uriel to free his armies
and lead them in a war against evil, Yahweh

00:02:49.709 --> 00:02:54.549
decided to address the most powerful humans
on earth, and enlist them in his fight.

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:59.419
Those same arrogant humans who foolishly believed
they’d been containing him all this time,

00:02:59.419 --> 00:03:02.719
and not that he’d simply been choosing to
stay with them.

00:03:02.719 --> 00:03:04.749
Perhaps now, they would see sense.

00:03:04.749 --> 00:03:10.739
Yahweh manifested physically in thirteen different
places at once and spoke to the O5 Council.

00:03:10.739 --> 00:03:15.599
They were filled with awe and holy terror
as the deity appeared before them like a glittering

00:03:15.599 --> 00:03:19.049
ghost, eyes glowing, exuding pure power.

00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:20.230
Speaking with absolute authority, he said:

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.230
“Uriel, my servant, once told your Founder
to prepare for the great and terrible day

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.230
of the Lord.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:23.230
This day now approaches.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.230
Make your final preparations.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.230
There is nothing else you will need to do
but wait.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.900
My armies ride across the Earth.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.099
Soon I will call the Four Horsemen.

00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:45.909
Once the last judgment has been unsealed,
then shall the great and terrible day of the

00:03:45.909 --> 00:03:48.330
Lord come.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:55.599
And then all will have Paradise.”

00:03:55.599 --> 00:04:01.040
And with that, he was gone, leaving the most
powerful human beings on Earth shaken.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:05.090
It was about time they got a reality check
about their true cosmic insignificance.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:10.819
Still, the act of splitting himself thirteen
ways briefly gave Yahweh symptoms similar

00:04:10.819 --> 00:04:12.040
to vertigo.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.790
During his confinement, he hadn’t needed
to truly flex his power, and now he was finally

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.730
beginning to feel the limitations of this
human form.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:24.410
But he didn’t have time to muse over the
nature of human frailty as the world he’d

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.420
worked so hard on began to crumble around
him.

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:32.410
He needed to return to the Valley, the precursor
to Eden’s return.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.550
The Valley where only He had set foot.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:41.570
He breathed a sigh and teleported there, prepared
to finally be alone and collect his thoughts…

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.750
But he wasn’t alone.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:46.690
You’ve probably heard salacious stories
about parties getting out of hand.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:51.950
It always goes the same way: A birthday party
or small gathering created as an event on

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:54.630
Facebook, but accidentally set to public.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:05:01.180
Not long after, little Andrea’s quinceañera
or Joe’s Bar Mitzvah suddenly has 5000 attendees,

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:05.580
all strangers, and the riot police are called
in to get the chaos under control.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:11.110
Now imagine that same thing, but instead of
rowdy drunkards, it’s cosmic figures and

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:14.860
apocalyptic beings from all over the multiverse.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.770
And now you know what Yahweh walked in on.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.230
Welcome to the Valley of Gods and Monsters.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:25.590
It was crowded with beings that would boggle
your mind to even comprehend.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:29.350
Deities with two limbs, six limbs, a hundred
limbs, or none.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:34.490
Spirit whales and feathered snakes flew overhead,
with clouds of intelligent insects and fae

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:35.950
flying just below.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:40.460
A giant furred creature moved over a distant
mountain, looking on.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:45.450
A pure black humanoid entity appeared before
Yahweh, blinked, and then vanished.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:52.040
Moments later, a giant centipede-like creature
skittered past him, giving him a nasty glare.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.240
Everyone was here.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.850
The pantheon of Greek Gods, from Zeus to Hades.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.930
Every Egyptian God and Monster.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:03.960
The bird-headed Ra, the Jackal-headed Anubis,
the monstrous snake-beast Apep.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:08.840
The Norse Gods were drinking and having rowdy
conversations with the Hindu deities.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:13.040
Entities so ancient their names have been
forgotten, and monsters whose faces had only

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:18.610
ever been seen in the restless dreams of billions
of humans, then quickly forgotten upon waking.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:21.850
In short, “The gang’s all here!”

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:26.700
Yahweh, for the first time ever, was feeling
lost, confused, and even small.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:31.800
He decided to mingle with a crowd of humanoid
Gods, wanting to be with people who looked

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:32.800
like him.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:37.450
There, he met a dark-skinned woman with long
hair and lip piercings known as Asherah.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:42.040
Although his memory of her was faint, she
reminded him that she was once his consort,

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:46.960
back before he made the admittedly jerk move
of wiping out all the other pantheons of history

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.900
so that he could rule over the cosmos alone.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:55.640
But now, with the opening of The Lock, everyone
was back, ready to cause the apocalypse.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:07:00.000
But here was the big problem: They didn’t
just want to cause the apocalypse, they wanted

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.300
to cause their apocalypse.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:07.790
Every belief system had its own vision for
how this strange little show we called Earth

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.790
should end, and not all of them were compatible,
so a very heated debate was breaking out as

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:16.030
to who should really get to bring the world
to an end.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:18.150
And the most darkly funny part of this?

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:23.600
Very few of these Gods, entities, and creatures
even knew about each other until a few moments

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:29.200
before, so the fact that they had this level
of competition was a very unpleasant surprise.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:34.390
To put it into perspective, imagine you’re
Neil Armstrong, circa 1969, taking the Apollo

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.370
Eleven shuttle straight to the Moon.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:40.790
The craft lands, he’s suited up, preparing
for the first-ever moonwalk - his iconic quote,

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:45.840
“This is one small step for a man, one giant
leap for mankind” already looping through

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:46.840
his head.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.970
Then when he steps off the craft, there are
already several people on the lunar surface,

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:54.020
lounging on deck chairs and asking him if
he’d like a beer.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:57.290
When he asks them what the hell is going on,
they tell him they just got here an hour ago

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.580
and were making themselves comfortable.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:04.190
Yahweh was beginning to realize that perhaps
he really didn’t hold the sway he thought

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.190
he did.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:08.910
Any bible fans in our audience will know that
the plan for the Christian apocalypse is laid

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:13.950
out pretty clearly in the Book of Revelations
- Satan, armies of angels, giant scorpion

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.610
locusts, and in the end, the rebirth of paradise
on earth.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:22.260
Yahweh thought, all things considered, his
version of the end of everything actually

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:27.290
shook out pretty well for everybody, a little
temporary Hell On Earth and painful damnation

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.290
aside.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:33.979
But here, he wasn’t the Holy of Holies,
he was just one guy with a big-picture idea,

00:08:33.979 --> 00:08:39.620
alongside so many other beings, each with
their own big-picture designs for ending things.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.329
All except Asherah.

00:08:41.329 --> 00:08:46.019
She’d spent time in a mortal form on Earth
and had really grown to like the place in

00:08:46.019 --> 00:08:47.110
that time.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:51.279
So much so that she didn’t want to see it
end in any manner - In her own words, to a

00:08:51.279 --> 00:08:53.029
baffled and somewhat offended Yahweh:

00:08:53.029 --> 00:08:57.970
“I may have been called here, but not even
that Lock can make me end the world.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.240
Have you ever tried the seafood in Singapore?

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.080
Have you ever used a smartphone?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.410
Ran through the jungle?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:04.769
Seen Cirque du Soleil?

00:09:04.769 --> 00:09:06.180
Flown on an airplane?

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.300
Surfed the Internet?

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.759
Watched tentacle porn?

00:09:08.759 --> 00:09:10.139
Seen Star Wars?

00:09:10.139 --> 00:09:11.829
Explored the Wanderer's Library?

00:09:11.829 --> 00:09:14.949
Been lost in the concrete mazes of the new
human cities?

00:09:14.949 --> 00:09:17.620
No, I like the world the way it is, thanks.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:21.439
It may be messed up, but tearing it apart
isn't going to improve anything.

00:09:21.439 --> 00:09:23.069
So no, I don't plan to end the world.

00:09:23.069 --> 00:09:26.769
I actually don't plan to let you end the world
either, or anyone else.

00:09:26.769 --> 00:09:27.769
Sorry.”

00:09:27.769 --> 00:09:31.310
Yahweh was somewhere between enraged and amazed.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:36.529
His former consort was not only willing to
go against him but every cosmic being here.

00:09:36.529 --> 00:09:41.730
She was staring down the barrel of quite literally
infinite power, and yet, she still stood in

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.029
defiance of them.

00:09:43.029 --> 00:09:47.339
Yahweh was about to retort when something
even more bizarre happened in the Valley of

00:09:47.339 --> 00:09:48.509
Gods and Monsters.

00:09:48.509 --> 00:09:54.670
A woman’s voice rang out, simply saying,
“Pardon me”, in a calm, even tone, that

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:58.029
somehow caught the attention of every deity
and world-ender in the valley.

00:09:58.029 --> 00:10:03.680
They turned in amazement to see a human woman
in a grey suit, standing among them.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:09.730
A face that, somehow, all these supposedly
all-knowing beings couldn’t seem to recognize.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:15.369
But if you SCP Explained fans have been perceptive
in the previous videos, it’s a face you’ll

00:10:15.369 --> 00:10:18.089
know all too well: The Administrator.

00:10:18.089 --> 00:10:20.980
Never shifting her tone or raising her voice,
she said:

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:24.529
“I come on behalf of the SCP Foundation.

00:10:24.529 --> 00:10:26.250
Some of you know who we are.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.529
Some of you do not.

00:10:27.529 --> 00:10:30.509
The Foundation are the protectors of humanity.

00:10:30.509 --> 00:10:35.200
Some of you we have imprisoned, some of you
we have bargained with, all in defense of

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.200
humanity.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.369
I have come to talk.”

00:10:37.369 --> 00:10:39.100
Some of the entities laughed.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.149
Others sneered.

00:10:40.149 --> 00:10:45.160
Was this woman really arrogant enough to believe
that humans had a seat at this table?

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:51.139
No, their place was resting on the plates,
subject to the mercy of teeth and silverware,

00:10:51.139 --> 00:10:52.899
not conversation.

00:10:52.899 --> 00:10:57.759
They asked her what she wanted, more out of
morbid curiosity than any real desire to know.

00:10:57.759 --> 00:10:58.759
She replied:

00:10:58.759 --> 00:11:02.110
“We can open the way to worlds free of sentient
life.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.170
Many worlds.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:04.819
Enough room for all of you.

00:11:04.819 --> 00:11:06.750
You won't have to end this world.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.560
No humans will have to die.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.699
You will have a hundred others.

00:11:10.699 --> 00:11:14.990
I want you to let this world live out the
rest of its history in peace.

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:18.129
And in return for this...We will not destroy
you.”

00:11:18.129 --> 00:11:19.290
Some laughed.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.499
Others chided.

00:11:20.499 --> 00:11:22.550
Most just remained in silence.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:26.790
When none accepted The Administrator’s offer,
she simply shrugged, and calmly delivered

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:31.379
what seemed less like a threat, and more like
an ironclad promise to the Valley of Gods

00:11:31.379 --> 00:11:32.379
and Monsters.

00:11:32.379 --> 00:11:34.420
“We are the Foundation.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.970
We will not worship you.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:37.760
We will not join you.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.629
We will not go back to hiding in fear of you.

00:11:40.629 --> 00:11:46.221
I hope you will change your minds, but we
will stand against you, and alone, if we have

00:11:46.221 --> 00:11:47.221
to.

00:11:47.221 --> 00:11:48.221
All of you.”

00:11:48.221 --> 00:11:54.399
And for a fleeting moment, before The Administrator
vanished, Yahweh thought of Himself as SCP-343.

00:11:54.399 --> 00:11:56.610
Then...She was gone.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:02.600
At that moment, the war for the fate of Planet
Earth had truly begun.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:08.800
Now go check out “Children of SCP-001 The
Scarlet King - Is SCP-999 Really His Son?”

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:15.160
and “SCP-001 Ouroboros Cycle - The Full
Story Compilation” for more of the universe-shattering

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.100
implications of SCP-001!

